# Pricing rules

## Bundles

A product may have a bundle offer: `bundle_size` units for `bundle_price`. An order pays for as
many whole bundles as fit and the unit price for the rest, so 7 units of a 3-for-10.00 product
cost 10.00 + 10.00 + 4.00. Every unit of a product in the order counts towards its bundles.

## Tax

Each product line is taxed at its category's rate in basis points (`__pkg__/tax.py`), rounded
half up to whole cents. Unknown categories use the default rate.

## Totals

Subtotal is the sum of line totals, Tax the sum of line taxes, and Total is Subtotal plus Tax.
